				location: "Paradise",
				Image: "./images/Saboten.png",
				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Saboten",
				Description: "<p>Sabotenjima, translating to 'Cactus Island', is one of the first seven islands found at the entrance of the Grand Line.</p><p>It is characterized by its gigantic mountains known as the 'Saboten Rocks' (サボテン岩, or Cactus Rocks). Their appearance derives from the countless graves dotted across the rockies which look like the needles of a cactus, in what is known as the Sapoten Graveyard (Captus Graveyard).</p><p>This island was used as a base for the criminal organization Baroque Works, which had several bounty hunters stationed at the island's only town, Whisky Peak. The log takes less than a full day to set.</p>",
