				Description: "<p>Vira is a small country found somewhere on the Grand Line, with a long history spanning over 400 years.</p><p>Four centuries ago, when explorer Mont Blanc Noland visited it during his initial month long run of the Grand Line, it was a peaceful and cheerful country, but in recent times, it fell into a precarious political situation, as it was subject to a Coup d'État, potentially influenced by the Revolutionary Army.</p><p>Given how Noland only spent only one month in the Grand Line during his first expedition, it is likely Vira is found in Paradise.</p>",
