				Description: "<p>Kyuka Island, translating to 'Vacation Island', is an island and Government affiliated nation found by the start of Paradise, not far from Little Garden.</p><p>Characterized by its colossal umbrella-shaped tree found at its center, the island is dotted with resorts and spa facilities, serving as a tropical getaway popular for those wishing to relax. The central tree serves as part of the resort, featuring rooms within the hollow tree trunk and an entire spa located at the top of it to enjoy the gorgeous views, with luxurious pools and other facilities.</p><p>This island was frequented by Mr. 3 during his vacation days, and also served as the setting of Miss Goldenweek's cover story.</p>",
