				location: "Paradise",
				Image: "./images/Boin-Archipelago.png",
				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Boin-Archipelago",
				Description: "<p>The Boin Island Chain (referred to by some as just the 'Boin Archipelago') is a group of deserted islands in Paradise that are actually not real land, but instead colossal carnivorous plants known as 'Stomach Barons' (ストマックバロン).</p><p>These enormous star-shaped plants are so large that they are often mistaken as islands, but any creature foolish enough to set foot on them will be swallowed alive as the plant closes in on itself to swallow its prey.</p><p>The Stomach Barons are covered in lush green forests of plants growing on them by the name of 'Greenstone', also known as the 'Woods of Gluttony', as several culinary delicacies and treats generated by the plant can be found there, in order to lure creatures onto the island to be swallowed. Usopp spent his timeskip training on this island with Heracles, a botanist who has been exploring the island and its peculiar flora for the past 25 years.</p>",
