				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Shade-Port",
				Description: "<p>Shade Port is a port town found somewhere on the Grand Line.</p><p>It is the island where Marshall D. Teach originates from, supposedly where he was born as the child of Eris and Rocks D. Xebec.</p><p>Teach was seen living on a tropical island seemingly located in the Grand Line for some years after God Valley up until he joined Whitebeard's crew, but it's unclear if this island was his homeland of Shade Port or some other place entirely. This town was seen as being fairly run down, seemingly suffering from poverty. When Whitebeard landed there 28 years ago, Teach begged him to let him board his ship due to having nowhere else to go. In reality, Teach was searching for the fabled Yami Yami no Mi (Dark Dark Fruit), and was hoping to have a higher chance at locating it if he sailed with the Whitebeard Pirates.</p>",
