				Image: "./images/Porco-Kingdom.png",
				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Porco-Kingdom",
				Description: "<p>The Porco Kingdom, translating to the 'Pig Kingdom', was a monarchy located somewhere on the Grand Line.</p><p>Ginny originates from this kingdom, before she was taken as a slave at the tender age of 4. It's unknown if she was enslaved due to the country not being part of the Government, or if it is Government affiliated and she was just a victim of the underworld slave trading. Her brother, Emporio Ivankov, should supposedly be from the island as well, but it isn't fully clear if they are related by blood or became siblings when meeting as slaves.</p>",
