    			map: "index.html", 
				japName: "金時山",
				location: "Grand Line",
				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Mt-Kintoki",
				Description: "<p>Kintokiyama, translating to 'Mt. Goldentime', is an island found somewhere on the Grand Line, bearing a Government affiliated settlement.</p><p>As the name indicates, the island is fundamentally one large mountain. Some couple decades ago, the people of its village requested aid to the Marines after a bunch of vicious bears were causing continued attacks on the village. The Marines deployed Dr. Vegapunk, escorted by Borsalino, who had developed a device that could ward the bears away. However, they discovered that a young boy by the name of Sentomaru had defeated all the bears and was ruling as the boss of the mountain. He had been abandoned by the villagers due to his strength, but Vegapunk decided to take him in as his bodyguard.</p><p>Sentomaru is likely designed after Japanese folk hero Kintaro, later known as Sakata no Kintoki, and as such his home island takes its name from him.</p>",
