				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Nanimonai",
				Description: "<p>Nanimonaishima, translating to 'Nothing Island', is an island not far off from Alabasta.</p><p>In reality, it is the old feces of the colossal sea creature the Island Eater, which were big enough to be mistaken for an island by some explorers. Thus the island came to be known as 'Nothing Island', as it is not actual land.</p><p>Robin offered the Straw Hats to head there instead of taking the route through Little Garden by offering them an Eternal Pose, but Luffy preferred to stick to his journey.</p>",
