				Image: "./images/Ukkari.png",
				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Ukkari",
				Description: "<p>Ukkarionsenjima, translating to Accidental Hot-Spring Island, also stylized as 'Ukkari Hot-Spring Island' and sometimes shortened as just 'Onsenjima', is an island located in Paradise close to Alabasta.</p><p>A miner from Alabasta by the name of Goro dug several holes on the island to build a hot spring resort there, which he completed thanks to the help of Gedatsu after he landed on the island falling from Skypiea. By making a tunnel to the nearby Sandy Island, the Hotsprings can now be accessed by the people of the Alabasta Kingdom, making it a popular tourist location for its citizens.</p>",
