				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Kenzan",
				Description: "<p>Kenzantou, translating to to Mountsword Island, is the home island of the longarm people, found somewhere in Paradise.</p><p>The island's main feature are its sharp sword-shaped mountains, hence its name, upon which the kingdom's villages are built, connected by suspension bridges. The island's coasts also appear to be assailed by very fierce currents. It is located close to Namakura Island, which the longarms would constantly pillage.</p>",
