				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Long-Ring-Long-Land",
				Description: "<p>Long Ring Long Land is an island in Paradise in the shape of a ring with ten protrusions.</p><p>Due to the rising high tide of the area, which may have been as a result of an ancient weapon's nearby attack 800 years ago (where Enies Lobby now would sit) resulting in high tides, most of the island is submerged underwater, instead making its ten protrusions serve as ten individual islands. The island's full shape is only visible once for a few hours during the low tide every year when water gathers for the nearby Aqua Laguna, making traversal possible only during this period.</p><p>Each of the individual islands are characterized by being incredibly flat, hence their name, being essentially composed of a vast grassy steppe. As a result, most of the island's fauna and flora have also become incredibly loooooong. Its log takes less than a day to set, which leads to the island of Zousenjima (Shipbuilding Island). The Straw Hats landed on the southernmost of the islands.</p><p>The island is inhabited by a local tribe of nomads, who regularly change their settlements of huts every 3 years by moving to the next island in order to change pastures. Their culture and the nature of the island are inspired by the Mongolian steppe and their nomad tribes.</p>",
