				Description: "<p>St. Poplar is a Government affiliated country located on a certain island in Paradise that is connected to the northern Water Seven by train.</p><p>Known as the 'Spring Queen Town' (春の女王の町), this posh town's most distinguishing feature is the large castle in the town, featuring two giant gargoyles by its entrance and a colossal shell to crown its top. Its architecture lends it a distinct look that makes it a great location for tourism sightseeing. It also has a thriving trade industry, with one of their main supplies being lumber. It is where CP9 went after escaping Enies Lobby by following the Sea Train track.</p><p>The castle was designed after Castel Sant'Angelo in Rome.</p>",
