				Description: "<p>The Kamabakka Kingdom, translating to the 'Queerfilled Kingdom', is a non-Government independent monarchy on Momoiro Island characterized by its population of queer and gender non-conforming inhabitants, as evident in its name.</p><p>Grand Line Revolutionary Army Commander Emporio Ivankov rules over the island as King (or Queen whenever he feels it), having used his powers to surpass the barrier between genders. The Revolutionary Army also began using the island as its headquarters after being driven out of Baltigo. At the center of the island is the beautiful royal castle with several heart-shaped domes. It is likely inspired by Basil's Cathedral in Moscow, as Ivankov's name is Russian derived.</p>",
