				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"New-Marineford",
				Description: "<p>New Marineford is the name given to an island located at the very entrance of the New World.</p><p>It is adjacent to the Red Port behind it, which causes the bubbles of its Yarukiman Mangroves to extend all the way to New Marineford as well. The round island is host to a massive Marine base, originally G-1, but now replaced by a new fortress serving as the newly built current Marine Headquarters. The fortress features:</p><p>- Located at the top of the castle, with a balcony overlooking the sea, is an office for the Fleet Admiral, from where Sakazuki remains glued to his desk.</p><p>- A meeting chamber much like the one in Marineford can be found on the higher levels, where similarly Brannew hosts meetings on bounties and other important topics.</p><p>- Several high-ranking Marines hold offices in the fortress, including Admiral Kizaru.</p><p>- A mess hall where Marines go to eat is found somewhere in the building.</p>",
