				Description: "<p>Buggy Town is a town established on Karai Bari Island to serve as the seat of Cross Guild.</p><p>Established by the Buggy Pirates sometime in the past two years, Buggy Town served as the headquarters of Buggy's Delivery, his mercenary organization as a Warlord, which later became Cross Guild. It is characterized by several circus tents dotting the coastline, with the largest one belonging to Buggy.</p>",
