				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Bunt-Kingdom",
				Description: "<p>The Bunt Kingdom is a monarchy located somewhere in the New World.</p><p>The Kingdom was seen 109 years ago, located on a small island and being characterized by its local architecture with angled roofs. Its royal castle has a cylidnrical shape, almost like that of a bottle, towering over the settlement below it, which is right next to a port. The island features some scant vegetation and a few small mountains. It is unknown whether the kingdom is Government affiliated or not, or what its current status is at present, but its king from a century ago was briefly seen.</p><p>109 years ago, a circus troupe in the kingdom rescued a giant from Samuwanai in the South Blue by the name of Ida and helped her make a living by having her perform as a circus attraction. King Harald of Elbaph, visiting the island, unknowingly destroyed the town to free her, but Ida taught Harald to be better and rebuilt the town with his help, establishing good relations between both races. This served as a trigger for Harald's changes in the policies of Warland in years to come.</p>",
