				Description: "<p>UMIT Shipping HQ, formally known as the 'Maritime Company UMIT Shipping Headquarters', is the base of the company UMIT Shipping, a transportation firm which organizes deliveries far and wide, located somewhere in the world.</p><p>Umit Shipping is a company led by Umit, an Underworld Emperor who is known by the epithet of 'Deep Ocean Current'. It has a vast network that will provide all kinds of materials to whoever need them, though this also involves shady Underworld dealings. Umit first appeared at Big Mom's Tea Party, but his company also made an appearance when providing materials for the construction Egghead or distributing Elbaph lumber in Harald's flashback. After the Revolutionaries attempted a resource siege on Mary Geoise, the headquarters were assaulted to stop transport of food to the Holy Land.</p>",
