				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Dyed Goods Town",
				Description: "<p>Somemono Town, translating to Dyed Goods Town, is a town somewhere in the world that is known for its production of flags.</p><p>Located in a fairly windy area, the winds not only power its many windmills, but also help dry the many flags this town produces for several clients all around the world. Among them, there is a fabric said to be unbreakable, making for excellent flags. Bellamy visited this town and became an apprentice under the local famous dyer Serizawa to draw a new flag for the Straw Hat Pirates.</p>",
