				Image: "./images/Foot-Colony.png",
				Class: "tiny",
				Id:"Foot-Colony",
				Description: "<p>Foot Colony is an island found somewhere in the world. Its name is a pun on futokoroni (懐に), or 'to pocket all the money'.</p><p>Being a fairly small flat island without much else on it, Foot Colony was the seat of the International Charity Federation Temple (国際慈善連盟寺院). This Temple, featuring a large walled courtyard with three large towers within it, served as the headquarters of the International Charity Federation (国際慈善連盟), a Government affiliated non-profit organization seeking to raise money for charitable efforts such as helping poor children in need. In reality, it appears this entire charity was a scam, aiming to hoard the money for themselves. Several monks staffed the building, with a High Priest (大僧正) running the Temple.</p><p>42 years ago, the Rocks Pirates raided Foot Colony to steal its treasures, and large part of its Temple was destroyed by Whitebeard's powers. The Marines set a blockade around the island to try and stop the pirates after Ouchoku tipped them off, but were completely annihilated.</p>",
