				Description: "<p>The Nemugiri Chitai, or Sleepfog Belt, is a sea area that induces sleep to those who cross it. It is located in the stretch between Egghead and Elbaph.</p><p>When the Straw Hats crossed this area, they fell asleep due to the properties of this sea area. They were subsequently abducted in their sleep by Road's crow Muginn.</p>",
