				Image: "./images/Baratie.png",
				Class: "middle",
				Id:"Baratie",
				Description: "<p>The Sea Restaurant Baratie, pronounced as 'Kaijou Restaurant Baratieh' and technically translable as 'Rose Pavillion', is a ship that hosts a restaurant inside of it.</p><p>Built by the retired pirate 'Red-Leg' Zeff alongside a young Sanji, the Baratie is meant to serve as a restaurant in the middle of the sea for those that need to eat while on their journey or when stranded at sea. The restaurant originally had two floors, with the first floor serving as the main dining room, the second floor serving as the Employee Dining Room, and the third floor serving as personal quarters.</p><p>As of recent, the restaurant has expanded by adding several floors, as well as two new ships, the Nasugasira (ナスガシラ号) which serves teppanyaki and Sister Anko (シスターアンコー), a submarine that serves desserts</p><p>The Baratie was directly inspired by the Baratei, a restaurant in Kumamoto where Oda worked at part time when he was young.</p>",
