				Description: "<p>The Oykot Kingdom is a Government affiliated monarchy located somewhere in the East Blue.</p><p>This Kingdom was victim to a vicious conflict 19 years ago, which resulted in Marines being dispatched to the kingdom, though the casualties ended up being many. In a town ravaged by the conflict, a surviving Bellemere found an orphan Nami and Nojiko, and took them in as her daughters. It's unknown how much of Oykot currently remains after the conflict.</p><p>Oykot is simply 'Tokyo' spelled backwards. Oda mentioned that during the early stages of Strong World he was planning to reveal the real truth of Nami's past prior to Oykot, but eventually preferred not to tackle it in the movie. It's unknown if he will ever follow up on this or if Nami will be kept as simply an orphan resident of Oykot.</p>",
