				Description: "<p>The Pole Star Archipelago is a small set of mainly two islands found in the south-western side of East Blue, right next to the entrance to the Grand Line.</p><p>On the south-western side of the larger main island is Loguetown, a major town in the East Blue. On the edge of the town is a lighthouse known as the 'Light of Guidance' (導きの灯), illuminating the direction to the entrance of the Grand Line.</p><p>Interestingly, the archipelago's name mirrors that of Lode Star Island, the final location of the Grand Line, which may bear symbolic significance as the starting and ending points of Roger's initial journey.</p>",
