				Class: "middle",
				Id:"Tequila Wolf",
				Description: "<p>Tequila Wolf is a country located upon a colossal bridge of the same name that stretches over the sea of the East Blue.</p><p>It is one of the four great bridges that the Government has been building for the past 700 years. Its true purpose is not publicly known, but it is believed by some the four bridges were built to provide a way to cross the world should it flood further.</p><p>The bridge has been built with the work of countless slaves across the past seven centuries, who have suffered and died to bring forth its construction, currently yet unfinished. The slaves and their slavers would build settlements along the bridge, which would be abandoned every few years to continuously move forward. The bridge was liberated by the Revolutionary Army two years ago, who were also able to locate Nico Robin there after she was sent to the bridge by Kuma, though it's unclear if the liberation persisted or if construction restarted.</p>",
