				Class: "middle",
				Id:"Kano-Country",
				Description: "<p>The Kano Country, translating to Flower Country, is a Levely-elective monarchy somewhere in the West Blue.</p><p>Ruled by King Ramen, it is known for its powerful military force, the Happo Navy (八宝水軍). Currently under the command of the 13th generation leader Don Sai, following legendary pirate Don Chinjao, this fleet of turtle ships has now declared independence from the country to swear loyalty to the Straw Hat Grand Fleet. Located in a mountainous area, Kano's capital is distinguished by its tall royal castle and the large bridge that extends from it.</p><p>The Kano Country is likely inspired by Korea, as it shares its architecture and ship design, with its name likely derived from the Japanese name of South Korea, being the Kan Country.</p>",
