				Description: "<p>Souja Island, translating to Twinsnakes Island, is a Government affiliated island located somewhere in the West Blue.</p><p>While there, Issho lost all his money at a gambling house, so he was forced to work as a bodyguard for the establishment. The World Government however bought him to make him a Marine Admiral during the World Military Draft.</p><p>The name could potentially refer to the concept of twin snake eyes in gambling, which means rolling two ones with two dice.</p>",
