				Description: "<p>The SMILE Factory was the factory where SMILE fruits were being developed, the artificial devil fruits that Doflamingo would resell as Joker on the black market, mainly for his main client Kaidou.</p><p>Originally found on the southern side of the Trade Port, right under where the Corrida Coliseum stood, during the birdcage incident, the Factory was moved up above on ground level, but was ultimately destroyed by the efforts of the Tontatta, who were originally enslaved to operate the factory.</p><p>Within the factory were several trees which were irrigated with SAD, a condensed extract of animal bloodline elements that would turn the tree's fruits into SMILEs, artificial devil fruits, though ones with a 10% chance of turning you into an animal… or part of your body at least. Due to originally being underground, the trees were illuminated by luminous plants called elegant sunflowers, located atop the glass roof. The entire factory was reinforced with seastone, making it impenetrable without access from within it or through the dedicated keys.</p><p>The factory was under the supervision of Factory Manager Kyuin, who fittingly bears a tattoo saying 'factory' on her arm.</p>",
