				Description: "<p>The World Government is an oligarchical federation (though secretly an absolute monarchy) composed by around 170 affiliated nations that claims hegemony and ownership over the entire world.</p><p>The World Government deems its rule absolute, with any countries that don't conform under its federation being deemed illegal territory without humanitarian rights. Countries can be elected to join the World Government (or can be demoted) as long as they are able to pay a large tax called the Celestial Tribute to enrich its aristocracy, the Celestial Dragons. Among the 170 or so nations that form it, 50 of them are given the privilege to be Levely-elective, allowing them to attend the World Congress Levely (世界会議/レヴェリー), a week-long conference taking place every four years to discuss the matters of the world. Becoming Levely-elective is a coveted position for a country, as it gives them the influence to voice their needs on a global stage.</p><p>Given the World Government's immense military power, possessing their personal immense military called the Marines, very few are able to oppose its control. Nations operating under the Government are still allowed to have their own laws and rulers governing them, and the Government generally does not interfere in most internal affairs of its nations, but still maintains complete authority whenever it deems necessary. Several non-affiliated countries exist however, though the Government frequently attempts to conquer, erase, and replace these cultures, particularly in their triennial Genocide Tournaments (先住民一掃大会), which is why several of them are either fairly hidden or protected by powerful entities, such as the territories of the Four Emperors in the New World.</p><p>The World Government was founded 800 years ago by 19 human monarchs (historically 20, though one was considered lost) who formed a faction called the Allied Powers (連合軍) against the immense Kingdom of the D. clan. To erase the Kingdom's ideals, the Government further erased almost all records of the Void Century, and caused a rise in sea levels through the use of an ancient weapon leaving most of the world submerged, making it easier to subjugate and control. The 19 human monarchs founded the Holyland Mary Geoise as their new capital atop the Red Line, attaining the political and social status of 'Gods', being allowed to do, kill, or own whatever they desire, a right passed to their direct descendants, who inherited the title of Celestial Dragons, all carrying the title of 'Saint'.</p><p>Publicly, the Government is an oligarchy ruled by a council of elders known as the Five Elder Planets, five elite Celestial Dragons taking in the input of the rulers of each respective country and the desires of other Celestial Dragons to pass political decisions, spreading the notion that no individual person shall seize the power of the world. In reality, it is an absolute monarchy, as one of the 19 founders, King Nerona Imu, attained perennial youth and has been ruling the world for 800 years as what some call the 'King of the World' (世界の王), a secret known only to a select few, though the likes of Doflamingo were seemingly aware of Imu's existence. While the elders take care of most of the work, Imu has complete control over the politics of the world. In truth, the Five Elder Planets have also shown to be perennially youthful, and they are granted special devil powers by Imu, though they can also be demoted and replaced with other high-ranking Celestial Dragons should they fail to follow through with their orders.</p>",
